  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.3 — Bug fixes + improvements\n• Dashboard page now loads correctly — JS syntax error in search function fixed\n• Footer and sidebar version labels now show correct version numbers\n• Export button correctly shows JSON and CSV options\n• CSV export now includes all enriched properties (RequestId, ElapsedMs, RequestPath etc.) as additional columns, not just the base 5 columns\nv1.0.2 — Bug fix\n• Dashboard page JS syntax error fixed; Export button split into JSON and CSV\nv1.0.1 — New features\n• Copy correlation ID to clipboard — ⧉ button in detail panel with 1.5s confirmation\n• Shareable URL with active filters — filters encoded in URL hash, restored on page load\n• WithDashboard(out sink, minLevel) — per-sink minimum level for dashboard\n• Regex search toggle — .* button switches between plain text and RegExp search\n• Buffer capacity in stats bar — shows actual configured capacity from server\n• CSV export alongside JSON export\n• Reconnect indicator — shows retry count during SignalR reconnect\nv1.0.0 — Stable release\n• Real-time SignalR WebSocket streaming\n• 500-event circular buffer replayed on connect\n• Level filter, service filter, full-text search, time filter\n• Properties tab, Stack trace tab, Details tab\n• Export JSON, dark/light theme, auto-scroll, pause/resume\n• Bearer JWT, shared token, IP allowlist, Basic auth, role check — 6 auth modes\n• Redis multi-pod backplane support\n• JWT expiry detection\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/CHANGELOG.md",
